      "subject": "diwɛn jɔkɔrɔ",
      "rationale": "הקפאים על שמריהם: misali bɔra diwɛn min ma ɲagami, o kokɔrɔna a jɔkɔrɔ la — a fɔcogo kelenkelen bɛ 'minnu balaki ka tɛmɛ, u yɛrɛ sirilen don u kokɔrɔ la'."
    },
    {
      "kind": "secret",
      "subject": "fitiriw ɲinini",
      "rationale": "Yawe bɛ Yerushalayim ɲini ni fitiriw ye — fenw minnu dogolen don, o ɲini; dogoli bɛna ye."
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "Yawe",
      "rationale": "Kuma in bɛ fɔ hadamaw kan minnu bɛ u dusukun kɔnɔ fɔ ko Yawe tɛ se ka nɔgɔya walima bonya."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "O waati kɔnɔ, an bɛna ⟨את⟩ Yerushalayim (Jerusalɛmu) ɲini ni fitiriw, ani an bɛna mɔgɔw jujɔ minnu kokɔrɔna i n'a fɔ u yɛrɛ ka diwɛn jɔkɔrɔ, minnu bɛ fɔ u dusukun kɔnɔ ko: Yawe tɛ se ka ɲuman kɛ, wa a tɛ se ka bɛman kɛ.",
